; Horse — model scene for AnimalDefinition.model_scenes.
; Source: Quaternius "Ultimate Animated Animal Pack" (July 2021), CC0 1.0 — same pack as
; Fox; see project/attribution/sources/quaternius_ultimate_animated_animals.tres.
;
; Design role: art.md → Newly Available Animals proposes open_grass, cultivated ·
; Bold, farm-tolerant · pasture animal, paired with Donkey. Not locked design.
;
; Audit (2026-07-26): 13 animation clips confirmed — Idle, Idle_2, Idle_Headlow,
; Idle_HitReact1/2, Walk, Gallop, Gallop_Jump, Jump_toIdle, Eating, Attack_Headbutt,
; Attack_Kick, Death. Idle/Walk both present and non-degenerate (52 tracks each). Node
; structure matches Fox (AnimalArmature -> Skeleton3D -> mesh; AnimationPlayer sibling
; index 1).
;
; Note: the pack also ships a "Horse_White" colour variant of this exact model
; (source-content/assets/.../glTF/Horse_White.gltf) — deliberately NOT imported here; only the 9
; animals in this task's scope were requested.
;
; Scale: 0.2, matching Fox's established factor for this pack (same rationale as
; Deer.tscn). Raw AABB height 4.824 -> scaled height 0.965, close to person-scale (Human
; wrapper normalizes to 1.0) — plausible for a horse viewed at withers/head height. FLAG
; FOR HUMAN REVIEW: not yet eyeball-confirmed in engine.
